    "desc": "Toxic Yuri VN Jam 2 · 2026\nSet in a modern Thai high school, Grade 12 (age 18)—the year of entrance exams, graduation pressure, and the fear of an uncertain future.\n\nCurse  ·  Dependency  ·  Self-destruction  ·  Isolation  ·  Fear of Graduation  ·  First Love  ·  Dysfunctional Relationship  ·  Toxic Yuri\nMain Characters\nEvelyn — Player\nAge 18 · Grade 12\nDistant, guarded, “hard to approach.”\nBelieves solitude is kindness.\nLucy\nAge 18 · Grade 12\nWarm, persistent, and fearless in a way that feels dangerous.\nShe wants to be more than “just friends”, no matter the cost.\nStory\nEvelyn begins the final school year expecting a quiet, lonely countdown to graduation—until Lucy keeps slipping into her routine that isn’t taken by chance but by choice.\n\nDay by day, Evelyn’s defenses start to soften into something more frightening, because every gentle moment carries a shadow: if they’re happy together, the xxxx takes more from Lucy. Lucy’s closeness begins to feel like xxxxxxxxx, Evelyn’s fear begins to twist into dependency. And as graduation draws nearer, their world narrows—until it.......\n\n\n\nThis Game have alternative ending",
